Add versioned database schema and repository interfaces with required user ownership for servers, views, revisions, operations and audit entries. Separate service bootstrap settings from user config. Implement expected-revision conflict checks, atomic transactions, explicit deletion, schema upgrades and retention. Acceptance: same names coexist for two users; reads/writes always scope by owner; missing identity never selects global config; concurrent writers and rollback tested.
